	(text "Cap board of the battery chain seam (spec section 3a): sits on the riser of a battery board and carries the spring-pin\nstrip that presses on the target pads of the board above. Pin n to pin n, 16 lines, no parts. Nets are numbered by\npin (LINE1-LINE16), not by pack: the two pins of a pack line are joined on the battery board and the connector layer."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
